{"id":"2e54d7c09866228f","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-smn.md","title":"S-m-n Theorem","display":"thm-smn — S-m-n Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-smn","aliases":["88-thm-smn"],"display":"thm-smn — S-m-n Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-kleene-equality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-smn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-smn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smn — S-m-n Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a> 的共同编号环境。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a>；该性质在断言前件中要求。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 已引入的固定元组编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(s:\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是待构造的参数固化函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smn}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists s\\;\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smn}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists s\\;\n\\mathrm{SMN}_{m,n}(s)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\">\\(m,n\\)</span>。构造一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_n\">\\(\\Psi_n\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\mathrm{enc}(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\">\\(d=\\mathrm{enc}(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\\)</span>，则其第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 个函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec y\">\\(\\vec y\\)</span> 上模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\)</span>；非法码处处发散。编码可判定解码，故该编号有部分可计算通用求值器。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元部分可计算函数都有一个忽略前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m+n)\">\\((m+n)\\)</span> 元实现，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_n\">\\(\\Psi_n\\)</span> 也是满编号。</p>\n<p>由可接受性取得总可计算翻译 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(e,\\vec x)=t(\\mathrm{enc}(e,\\vec x))\">\\(s(e,\\vec x)=t(\\mathrm{enc}(e,\\vec x))\\)</span>，即有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{s(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\\simeq\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)\">\\(\\varphi_{s(e,\\vec x)}^{(n)}(\\vec y)\\simeq\\varphi_e^{(m+n)}(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\)</span>。\n这同时证明参数函数的全定义性、可计算性以及共同发散情形。原文件缺失的编号前提已进入蕴涵前件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-smn-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,n\\in\\mathbb N^+$；$\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}$ 是 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]] 的共同编号环境。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]；该性质在断言前件中要求。","embed"